{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "76eeb29d-208e-8d9a-b455-81178da02986",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T14:55:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:52:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. [pause] I'm calling about old records. Genealogy, I suppose you'd call it. Birth and marriage records from the 1930s."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:52:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me make sure I have that right. You're looking for birth and marriage records, from the nineteen thirties, here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Newport. Those would be, um, for my wife's side of the family. Her people were here then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Records that old are handled a little differently than recent ones. Some of them are open to the public and some have a few more steps. Do you have names and roughly the years?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the names, and the years within two or three. [pause] I didn't want to come down until I knew what was needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's sensible. Usually you'd send in the names, the approximate dates, and how you're related, and we search from there. If you come in, you can fill out the request at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what is the fee? For a copy, or for the search."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a fee for certified copies, and I believe the search is separate from that. I don't have the exact amounts in front of me, and I'd rather not read you the wrong number. I can have someone call you back with it, or I can email you the request form with the fee schedule attached."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email would be better. [pause] Though there's a problem with that. I tried to reset my email password this morning, and it sent the code to an old phone number. One I haven't had in years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. So you can't get into the email right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. So I can't receive anything there today. I'll have to sort that out with the email company."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's something they'd have to fix, we can't help with that side. In the meantime I can mail the form to you. Or if you like, I can note your number and have the fee information read to you by phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The phone is fine. It's 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six seven. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Diogo Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Medeiros. I'll leave a note for the records staff to call you with the fee and the steps for the thirties records. It may be Monday, with the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday is fine. Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T14:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
